<view class="container game-page">
  <view class="topline">
    <text class="game-kicker">思维闯关 · 12</text>
    <text class="title-badge">5×5</text>
  </view>
  <view class="title-row">
    <text class="game-title">数织</text>
    <text class="title-badge">图像推理</text>
  </view>
  <view class="game-lead">行和列旁边的数字，表示这一行/列连续涂色的段长。把隐藏图案推出来。</view>

  <view class="status-line">
    <text class="status-strong">{{status}}</text>
    <text class="mono">{{puzzleName}}</text>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{win}}" class="win-banner">
    <text class="win-icon">🎉</text>
    <view class="win-copy">
      <text class="win-title">完成！你解出了「{{puzzleName}}」</text>
      <text class="win-sub">图案已锁定，点击“换一幅”继续。</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="nono {{win ? 'done' : ''}}">
    <view class="top-clues">
      <view class="corner"></view>
      <view class="col-clue" wx:for="{{colClues}}" wx:key="index">{{item}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="row-line" wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="index" wx:for-index="ri">
      <view class="row-clue">{{item.clue}}</view>
      <view class="cell {{cell.on ? 'on' : ''}} {{cell.hint ? 'hint' : ''}}" wx:for="{{item.cells}}" wx:for-item="cell" wx:for-index="ci" wx:key="ci" data-r="{{ri}}" data-c="{{ci}}" bindtap="tapCell" hover-class="press"></view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="actions-row">
    <view class="btn-ghost" bindtap="showHint">提示一格</view>
    <view class="btn-ghost" bindtap="reset">重来</view>
    <view class="btn-primary" bindtap="newGame">换一幅</view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{hint}}" class="hint-box">{{hint}}</view>

  <view class="rule-box">
    <view class="rule-title">能学到什么 · 约束推理与图像</view>
    <view class="rule-text">一行 5 格，线索「3」表示三个连续涂色；「1 2」表示先一个、空至少一格、再两个。先找最长段。</view>
    <view class="rule-example">例：行线索「1 2」表示先连续涂 1 格，至少空 1 格，再连续涂 2 格。</view>
  </view>
</view>
